OL,3,GNEWSAHarry and Meghan in Nottingham for
OL,4,Afirst joint engagement since UK return
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Duke and Duchess of Sussex are met
OL,7,Fwith cheers and shouts of "I love you"
OL,8,Fas they tour Nottingham on their first
OL,9,Froyal-style joint engagement since
OL,10,Freturning to the UK
OL,12,FHarry and Meghan have arrived at
OL,13,FHimmah, a charity tackling food
OL,14,Fpoverty. "They're an amazing and
OL,15,Fspecial couple," says Lucy Beardsall,
OL,16,Fwho has been waiting with her husband
OL,17,FDarren to greet the pair
OL,19,FThe pair's first stop was the Community
OL,20,FRecording Studio (CRS) charity, a place
OL,21,FHarry has a long relationship with
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
