OL,3,GNEWSAHarry and Meghan in Nottingham for
OL,4,Afirst joint engagement since UK return
OL,5,
OL,6,FEmily Davis, 21, gave Meghan a bunch of
OL,7,Fyellow flowers. "I just said, 'I've
OL,8,Falways wanted to meet you'," she tells
OL,9,Fthe BBC, while Amanda Geary, 54, says
OL,10,Fshe's "been a fan of Harry ever since
OL,11,Fhe was born"
OL,13,FReece Sweeney-Fenton, who travelled
OL,14,Fwith his partner Kiara to be there,
OL,15,Fsays he is glad they're "giving England
OL,16,Fanother go"
OL,18,FHarry and Meghan are in the city where
OL,19,Fthey made their first joint appearance
OL,20,Fafter announcing their engagement in
OL,21,F2017
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
